{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Explore the Flags》是一款以國旗與世界地理為主題的教育 App，適合對旗幟著迷的兒童、家長及熱愛地理的讀者。它收錄 195 個國家資料、測驗與互動地圖，讓學習連結真實文化；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-275.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線探索世界地理</h2>\n<p>程式收錄 195 個國家，逐一亮出國旗、首都、語言、母語問候與趣味知識，並以文字轉語音朗讀超過 40 種語言的打招呼方式。用家可透過連勝測驗、國旗填色、互動世界地圖及州省資料加深認識，亦能標記去過的國家與地區；大部分內容可離線使用，適合兒童、家長與地理迷。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-346-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-347-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-348-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-349-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-350-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-351-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Explore the Flags</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/explore-the-flags/id6784823586?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T21:44:20.901103+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T21:19:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:55:38.014279+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T21:37:46.147670+00:00","content_hash":"6afd64168a9a0b9352cde3a2d4786b849bdfff326eff2e84cd58991d04614508","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}